{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "4de79be50743f767243065cb6e432a2afb6a428aceacc945e6b1cb224f0706f0", "ja": "蒸気の街で", "zh": "在蒸汽之城", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "f9a827895f12ffa6020056b610bb04e9799f1093b7f90b19c98eedb7c5828cb8", "ja": "高性能ロボットに敗れた人間たちが住まう\n『追放の街』で生きるセリカとタマキ。だが\nある日、タマキはロボットに仕えるために\n出て行ってしまう。残されたセリカが出会っ\nたのは、モモコというロボットだった。", "zh": "在败给高性能机器人的人类所居住的“放逐之城”中，星梨花和环努力生存着。然而某一天，环为了侍奉机器人而离开了。被独自留下的星梨花遇见的，是名为桃子的机器人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_02_1000_022ser", "source_sha256": "6aaf79ee44069113f6b865293e7700532a99cc0f98d8b47546369e9fb41e8352", "ja": "待ってタマキ！　機械都市に行くって……本気なの！？", "zh": "等等，环！你说要去机械都市……是认真的吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_02_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "58734baf806d528a7f64eb961e38629959b6e1de63bc444ba933cf7591241990", "ja": "やっと入隊許可が降りたんだ。機械都市の衛兵に\nなって、国家元首・マツリ様のために働く。", "zh": "好不容易才拿到入队许可的。我要成为机械都市的卫兵，\n为国家元首·松莉大人效力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_02_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "1f63814a13c3e07f728ec2e4ddea89bdd730503168f9ea214a6c056b148267ea", "ja": "どうして、ロボットなんかのために……！", "zh": "为什么要为机器人之类的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_02_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "5cd0dd6690feebd2257cf7e8f2a9419f55f2cbc8636d018b3edfd61ca7cae9aa", "ja": "しっ。そんなこと大きな声で言っちゃダメだ。\nセリカ、必ず戻るから、それまでこれを持っていて。", "zh": "嘘。那种话不可以大声说。\n星梨花，我一定会回来的，在那之前你先拿着这个。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_02_1004_022ser", "source_sha256": "029d5e2f0547961d6e83ace3d1340fe2e19186f4e09ee722f4b0c1672a8b96b7", "ja": "え？　あっ、タマキ……！", "zh": "咦？啊，环……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_02_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "39d764c28b9bf903e4fdae90cfc50926a308237204d4a5aab5949470a747a5d1", "ja": "これ……ペンダント？　でも、石が半分しかない。\nもう半分は……タマキが持ってるってこと？", "zh": "这……是吊坠？可是，宝石只有一半。\n另一半……是在环手那里吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_02_1006_se", "source_sha256": "435ce737398bffec4133621c46ce5fc59eade8feec4083259c243735ceb23aa0", "ja": "ガション……ガチャガチャ！　ブシュウ……。", "zh": "咔嚓……哐当哐当！呲……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_02_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "59555cdec681445b3462ffe5e7db88039d20d9dd146ff1f4f13c874b0fbe97f7", "ja": "（そうして、タマキは行ってしまった。\n……人間が、ロボットのために働く？）", "zh": "（就这样，环离开了。……人类，居然会为机器人工作？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_02_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "968c0dc89fe97f579ad880aa0c0eb77003d56b54d967ac785b50429dce228dda", "ja": "（……私とタマキは、どちらも戦争で親を亡くした。\nあの、冷徹なロボットたちとの戦争で）", "zh": "（……我和环都在战争中失去了父母。那场与冷酷无情的机器人们之间的战争。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_02_1009_022ser", "source_sha256": "15d6801273f366f4ea6f44eb14562bb6e3c157f4b55ca73cfde02b79abe5a364", "ja": "（その後、二人で力を合わせて、\nなんとか生き延びてこられたけど、ロボットは仇）", "zh": "（之后，我们两人齐心协力，好不容易活了下来，可机器人是我们的仇人。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_02_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "e39c47fe981af5f32a7143a13cfe847b1a722162d6e2dca8626cd9cf5234205a", "ja": "（なのにそのロボットにこき使われようだなんて。\n何も話してくれなかったけど、きっとタマキは……）", "zh": "（明明都这样了，竟然还要被那个机器人使唤得团团转。\n虽然它什么都没告诉我，但玉树她一定是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_02_1012_022ser", "source_sha256": "6230a33d6adc971de2bed1a0838f7de31026598b7e24119050709ff1f424ea14", "ja": "わあ！　びっくりした。お客さん……おつかいかな？\nえっと、肉まんでいい？", "zh": "哇！吓我一跳。客人……是来买东西的吗？那个，肉包可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_02_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "7c6004329f1837acde1f091e67cf3e856c15585ed32ee15ddf41716914c6e6fd", "ja": "（もしかして、お金ないのかな。私とタマキも……\nお腹を空かせた時、食べる物をくれた人がいた）", "zh": "（难道是没钱吗？我和玉树也是……\n在肚子饿的时候，也曾有人给过我们吃的）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_02_1014_022ser", "source_sha256": "0a88f111270dd88ef20376ffb8a96ddfd77d069a9d7688b53b7700b3b44fddc0", "ja": "あの……お腹空いてる？　食べる？", "zh": "那个……你肚子饿了吗？要吃吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_02_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "bd728ea1ffa32cdc8a00a845e18b4dfea7a675866fcf31b609fb9f6d77ab43ba", "ja": "（……？　動かない表情。きれいすぎる顔……。\nまさか、ロボット？）", "zh": "（……？毫无表情的脸。美得过分的容貌……。难道，是机器人？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_02_1017_020meg", "source_sha256": "c3dffcdb23cb7e8e19da77c58b2bdef796f9948975d84a56d08bd87be61a2b6e", "ja": "モモコー！！", "zh": "桃子——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_02_1018_020meg", "source_sha256": "360e43acc4d538dc0f1fe103e4ced8015f1d2601e26863c954287c2e7ca6ccb6", "ja": "よかった！　もう、勝手にどっか行ったらダメじゃん！\nあぁ～、ごめんね？　なんでもないから。それじゃ！", "zh": "太好了！真是的，别擅自乱跑啊！\n啊～抱歉哦？没事没事。那就这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_02_1019_022ser", "source_sha256": "5e5d6cd0f0f7043fedcda2ded03cfd422de344b64185071a76c8603a904637f9", "ja": "あ、はい……。", "zh": "啊，好的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_02_1020_022ser", "source_sha256": "18e1d0f50c4e107c930f6de8b607e8712af31cb13a7052eae4ce49b7048ec5e2", "ja": "（今の人は……人間、だよね。\n人間とロボットが、あんなふうになれるの……？）", "zh": "刚才那个人……是人类，对吧。人类和机器人，也能变成那样吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_02_1021_null", "source_sha256": "e1599a6990a99842fdc78af5f320d2fb386da80fbeaedbbf989b2fbf607f4639", "ja": "数日後……。", "zh": "几天后……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_02_1022_se", "source_sha256": "435ce737398bffec4133621c46ce5fc59eade8feec4083259c243735ceb23aa0", "ja": "ガション……ガチャガチャ！　ブシュウ……。", "zh": "咔嚓……哐当哐当！呲……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_02_1023_022ser", "source_sha256": "e2e6c34a62cb46b1487e8600f65054173b65f1c99413f6f6e1e9f25147d6672b", "ja": "できた。今日は全部、うまくいったかな……。", "zh": "做好了。今天是不是一切都很顺利呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_02_1025_022ser", "source_sha256": "368a719c4fc3fa3b656087910af3fcc0ba8d13e5cc889ab8cb5b551ddb459d55", "ja": "！　あなた、この間の……。\nもしかして、この機械が気になるの？", "zh": "！您是前些天的……。难道您对这台机器感兴趣吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_02_1026_022ser", "source_sha256": "703e23230bf7e9124b0da4cafd221d0019183c8efffb24077692b2b291388aca", "ja": "これは蒸気式肉まん製造機。自動で肉まんを\n作ってくれるんだけど……。食べる？", "zh": "这是蒸汽式肉包机。虽然它会自动做好肉包……要吃吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_02_1027_049mom", "source_sha256": "a9b9850a387bcbf70c08fc84282093987c72d06141884fe54c5d0aba3954e74d", "ja": "ん……、食べられない。", "zh": "嗯……不能吃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_02_1028_022ser", "source_sha256": "4a0c298ce83b99f30158b9f04c9a05f50bd650a819eff3a2615373e2408785a5", "ja": "喋れるの！？", "zh": "你会说话吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_02_1029_049mom", "source_sha256": "6b02ff87a6b6b8f31f9b91520deae021fc7af4dce9e97c202a62a7735f87ee87", "ja": "すこし。\n教えてもらってる、とちゅう。", "zh": "会说一点。\n还在学习中。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_02_1030_022ser", "source_sha256": "b273b6e1d6cfa1e3d1fd208735384e1d6d1c3a29a9431b3e0b09e928fe5264f7", "ja": "……ほんとだ、たどたどしいね。ロボットなのに。\nロボットなのに……。", "zh": "……真的呢，说话结结巴巴的。明明是个机器人。\n明明是个机器人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_02_1031_022ser", "source_sha256": "647b2a5a5c0379aa4e768233ddef82d0d13f6af1ade8e210fd8f9f9f4ec4dc09", "ja": "（この子はあんまり、怖くない）", "zh": "（这个孩子好像没那么可怕。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_02_1032_022ser", "source_sha256": "327f4de308a2093803e6998a69dce1fa05526ae69d7a119892bb39f686821885", "ja": "私は、セリカっていうの。\nあなたは……。", "zh": "我叫星梨花。\n你是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_02_1033_049mom", "source_sha256": "5a3cb74a8a1af977ef39cd2b79ac8ee349d85b36e6348f5568b60d586fa9351b", "ja": "モモコ……。", "zh": "桃子……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_02_1034_022ser", "source_sha256": "b3c7647b273644e4e5e9804061a5272d87f64158a103cd3b28e8d5446df9c80c", "ja": "モモコ。うん、そう呼ばれてたよね。よろしくね。\n……こんなにたくさん、久しぶりに喋ったかも。", "zh": "桃子。嗯，我以前确实是被这么叫的。请多关照。\n……我好像已经很久没说过这么多话了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_02_1035_022ser", "source_sha256": "6fe3cedce69db820ec17cd8ab0857c57fa56d1dae065c1e649c7582b455b84d2", "ja": "私、友達が……、いなくなっちゃったから。", "zh": "因为我的朋友……，都不在了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_02_1037_019min", "source_sha256": "7e201df879abd4a5f166548558551bc1fe434e62f92feac51eb748c0ed7bcddb", "ja": "う……、うぅ……。", "zh": "呜……呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_02_1038_022ser", "source_sha256": "96731e9601be36833736db349b23c9ea269bf33c7d09d2558dad9b4e1f576af1", "ja": "ええっ、何！？　だ、大丈夫ですか！？", "zh": "诶？！怎么了！？您、您没事吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_02_1039_019min", "source_sha256": "1155b7b551180d628c38506e45b2749e0e08cafab978a77531523a3794f440d8", "ja": "お……おなか……", "zh": "肚……肚子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_02_1040_022ser", "source_sha256": "54e3426e958ec824358b9297ce9674a0b963e792d5c3ac85d61d67422fa17b5e", "ja": "おなか！？　お腹が痛いの！？", "zh": "肚子！？你肚子疼吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_02_1041_019min", "source_sha256": "c3a60b1c4b1944cc77d1c6c9884fd0a7223382dc3879cc39526aad911b3123fd", "ja": "……おなか……すいた……", "zh": "……肚子……饿了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_02_1042_022ser", "source_sha256": "61d2e14821aae1b698426b117a463c3bb4533d2b5aa208e0a831db8e07fca65a", "ja": "……はぁ？", "zh": "……哈啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
